    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/a6f4ce87e6d03948f275fe9323a9b329.poster.avif?t=1668250419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/a6f4ce87e6d03948f275fe9323a9b329.webm?t=1668250419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/a6f4ce87e6d03948f275fe9323a9b329.mp4?t=1668250419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Overhaul</strong> is a rogue-lite puzzle game that combines fast-paced action and quick logical thinking. As <strong>Ikalee</strong>, venture deep into the abandoned <strong>Power Plant</strong> to bring the power back to your village. A place that has now been taken over by hostile and mysterious life forms.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THINK FAST, ACT FASTER</h2></strong> Solve logic-based puzzles in a fast-paced top down action game. Dodge, pick up enemies, carry objects and outsmart the most vicious of situations. Get ready to face all-new challenges every time!<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HUNDREDS OF HAND-CRAFTED ROOMS</h2></strong> Each time you manage to reach the Core, the <strong>Power Plant</strong> shifts and generates new traps that you'll have to triumph from in your next ventures. Each room is different, pick a difficult one for better rewards or an easier one if you want a smoother ride. It's up to you to carve your own path through the <strong>Power Plant</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/674161945d792b8dec6cf279690b8d55.poster.avif?t=1668250419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/674161945d792b8dec6cf279690b8d55.webm?t=1668250419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/674161945d792b8dec6cf279690b8d55.mp4?t=1668250419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLEASH DORMANT POWERS</h2></strong>Grow stronger by spending the energy you've collected in the <strong>Energy Well</strong>. Unlock new abilities and gather powerful items in your journey. <br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A RICH CAST OF MYSTERIOUS ENTITIES</h2></strong> Experiment and learn how the different entities interact with one another. Some will try to take you down but you can use them to your advantage.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER A HAND-DRAWN 2D WORLD</h2></strong> Discover what lies inside the <strong>Power Plant</strong> alongside a carefully composed score that matches with your progression. From moody melancholic ambiance to blood-pumping melodies!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/a6f4ce87e6d03948f275fe9323a9b329.poster.avif?t=1668250419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/a6f4ce87e6d03948f275fe9323a9b329.webm?t=1668250419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/a6f4ce87e6d03948f275fe9323a9b329.mp4?t=1668250419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Overhaul</strong> is a rogue-lite puzzle game that combines fast-paced action and quick logical thinking. As <strong>Ikalee</strong>, venture deep into the abandoned <strong>Power Plant</strong> to bring the power back to your village. A place that has now been taken over by hostile and mysterious life forms.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THINK FAST, ACT FASTER</h2></strong> Solve logic-based puzzles in a fast-paced top down action game. Dodge, pick up enemies, carry objects and outsmart the most vicious of situations. Get ready to face all-new challenges every time!<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HUNDREDS OF HAND-CRAFTED ROOMS</h2></strong> Each time you manage to reach the Core, the <strong>Power Plant</strong> shifts and generates new traps that you'll have to triumph from in your next ventures. Each room is different, pick a difficult one for better rewards or an easier one if you want a smoother ride. It's up to you to carve your own path through the <strong>Power Plant</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/674161945d792b8dec6cf279690b8d55.poster.avif?t=1668250419\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/674161945d792b8dec6cf279690b8d55.webm?t=1668250419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1608660/extras/674161945d792b8dec6cf279690b8d55.mp4?t=1668250419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLEASH DORMANT POWERS</h2></strong>Grow stronger by spending the energy you've collected in the <strong>Energy Well</strong>. Unlock new abilities and gather powerful items in your journey. <br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A RICH CAST OF MYSTERIOUS ENTITIES</h2></strong> Experiment and learn how the different entities interact with one another. Some will try to take you down but you can use them to your advantage.<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER A HAND-DRAWN 2D WORLD</h2></strong> Discover what lies inside the <strong>Power Plant</strong> alongside a carefully composed score that matches with your progression. From moody melancholic ambiance to blood-pumping melodies!",
    "short_description": "Solve your way through this fast-paced rogue-lite puzzle game and outwit unforgiving creatures as you venture into the mysterious Power Plant!",
